{"seq":3,"slug":"hydraulic-pneumatic","title":"液压与气动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/hydraulic-pneumatic","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"液压与气动\">液压与气动</h1><p>挖掘机的铲斗能撕开冻土、压机能冲出汽车覆盖件、工厂的气缸每分钟夹放上百次工件——这些靠<a href=\"motors-drives\">电机</a>或<a href=\"electromagnetic-piezo\">压电</a>都难以经济实现的大力、大行程动作，由流体动力（fluid power）承担。它的核心思想朴素而强大：用泵或压缩机把能量灌进流体，再用阀控制流体流向哪个执行元件，由帕斯卡原理把压力放大成巨力。这一篇讲清液压与气动两套系统的工作原理、元件构成、各自的取舍，以及它们如何与电控融合成电液/电气比例伺服。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流体动力系统都由「动力源—控制—执行—介质」四部分组成。液压用近不可压缩的油、气动用可压缩的空气，这一介质差异决定了两者几乎所有的性能分野。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  PWR[动力源&lt;br/&gt;液压泵/空气压缩机] --&gt; MED[加压介质&lt;br/&gt;油 不可压 / 空气 可压缩]&#10;  MED --&gt; CTRL[控制元件&lt;br/&gt;方向阀/压力阀/流量阀]&#10;  CTRL --&gt; ACT[执行元件&lt;br/&gt;液压缸/气缸/液压马达]&#10;  EL[电信号] --&gt; SOL[电磁阀/比例阀]&#10;  SOL --&gt; CTRL&#10;  ACT --&gt; LOAD[机械负载]&#10;  ACT --&gt; FB[位置/压力反馈]&#10;  FB --&gt; EL\">flowchart TD\n  PWR[动力源&lt;br/&gt;液压泵/空气压缩机] --&gt; MED[加压介质&lt;br/&gt;油 不可压 / 空气 可压缩]\n  MED --&gt; CTRL[控制元件&lt;br/&gt;方向阀/压力阀/流量阀]\n  CTRL --&gt; ACT[执行元件&lt;br/&gt;液压缸/气缸/液压马达]\n  EL[电信号] --&gt; SOL[电磁阀/比例阀]\n  SOL --&gt; CTRL\n  ACT --&gt; LOAD[机械负载]\n  ACT --&gt; FB[位置/压力反馈]\n  FB --&gt; EL</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>液压</th>\n<th>气动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>介质</td>\n<td>液压油（近不可压）</td>\n<td>压缩空气（可压缩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>力密度</td>\n<td>极高（数百 bar）</td>\n<td>中（6–8 bar）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>刚度/定位</td>\n<td>高、可精确停位</td>\n<td>低、难中间定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>中、平稳</td>\n<td>高、轻快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清洁/成本</td>\n<td>有泄漏、贵</td>\n<td>清洁、廉价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"帕斯卡原理-流体如何放大力\">帕斯卡原理：流体如何放大力</h2><p>液压的力放大来自帕斯卡定律：密闭流体中压强处处相等。若小活塞面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上施加力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，产生压强 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = F_1/A_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，这个压强作用到大活塞面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上就得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_2 = p\\,A_2 = F_1\\,\\frac{A_2}{A_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>面积比就是力的放大倍数——这就是为什么一台几十千瓦的泵能驱动数百吨的压机。代价由能量守恒决定：力放大多少倍，位移就缩小多少倍，输出端走得慢。压强本身则由系统压力等级决定，现代液压常工作在 200–350 bar，靠高压换取紧凑的执行元件。</p>\n<p>气动同样靠压强乘面积出力，但工作压力低得多（通常 6–8 bar），且空气可压缩，这两点让气动力小、且难以在行程中间精确停住——压住负载时空气像弹簧一样被压缩，位置会随负载变化漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元件构成-从泵阀到缸\">元件构成：从泵阀到缸</h2><p>无论液压气动，系统都由四类元件搭起来。<strong>动力源</strong>：液压用泵（齿轮泵、柱塞泵）把油加压，气动用压缩机产生压缩空气并经储气罐、干燥过滤。<strong>控制元件</strong>是流体动力的「大脑」，分三类——方向阀（决定流体去哪个口，电磁阀是其电控版本，正是<a href=\"electromagnetic-piezo\">电磁执行器</a>的典型应用）、压力阀（限压、卸荷、保安全）、流量阀（节流调速）。<strong>执行元件</strong>把流体能量变回机械运动：液压/气缸做直线运动，液压马达做连续旋转。</p>\n<p>气动有一个液压没有的麻烦也有一个便利：空气可压缩使其难精确控制，但也意味着气缸到位时可压缩性提供天然缓冲、过载时不会硬顶；而且空气取之不尽、泄漏无污染、系统简单廉价，所以装配线上的夹具、推料、分拣几乎是气动的天下。液压则在需要大力、高刚度、精确停位的工程机械、注塑机、机床里不可替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电控融合-比例阀与电液伺服\">电控融合：比例阀与电液伺服</h2><p>传统流体动力靠开关式电磁阀做「全开/全关」的离散控制，无法连续调节。现代系统引入<strong>比例阀与伺服阀</strong>：阀芯位移正比于输入电流，从而连续调节流量或压力，把流体动力纳入闭环。配合<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">位置/压力传感器</a>反馈，电液/电气比例伺服系统能实现媲美电伺服的精确力控与位置控，同时保留流体动力的大力优势——这正是重型机械力控、主动悬架、试验机加载的核心技术。</p>\n<p>控制上的难点恰来自介质特性：液压油里溶解的空气、管路弹性会降低系统刚度引入谐振；气动的强可压缩性使其呈现明显的非线性与时滞，常需要专门的非线性控制或前馈补偿。这些控制环的实现，与电机的<a href=\"motors-drives\">闭环控制</a>共享同一套传感—调理—控制器思路，只是被控对象换成了流体。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制方式</th>\n<th>调节能力</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开关电磁阀</td>\n<td>离散通断</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>夹具、推料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比例阀</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>调速、力控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伺服阀 + 反馈</td>\n<td>连续闭环</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>试验机、主动悬架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选型与系统取舍\">选型与系统取舍</h2><p>在三类执行技术里定位：要纳米到微米精度选<a href=\"electromagnetic-piezo\">压电/音圈</a>，要高效可控的旋转或中等力直线选<a href=\"motors-drives\">电机</a>，要大力、大行程、高刚度且能承受恶劣环境选液压，要轻快、清洁、低成本的重复动作选气动。流体动力的系统级代价是需要泵站/气源、管路、过滤维护，且有泄漏与噪声；但在力密度这一维度上，至今没有电驱方案能与之竞争。把流体执行器接入<a href=\"../systems/iot-smart-sensing\">传感反馈与边缘控制</a>，正让传统液压气动走向数字化、可预测维护的智能流体动力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流体动力用泵/压缩机给流体灌能、用阀控流向、靠帕斯卡原理把压力放大成巨力，承担电驱难以经济实现的大力大行程动作。</li>\n<li>力放大 = 面积比，代价是位移按比例缩小（能量守恒）；液压高压（200–350 bar）换紧凑，气动低压（6–8 bar）力小。</li>\n<li>介质差异定全局：液压油不可压→高刚度、可精确停位；空气可压缩→轻快清洁廉价但难中间定位、有弹簧效应。</li>\n<li>系统四元件：动力源、控制阀（方向/压力/流量，电磁阀即电控接口）、执行元件、介质；比例阀+反馈实现连续闭环力控。</li>\n<li>选型按精度/力/环境在<a href=\"electromagnetic-piezo\">压电音圈</a>、<a href=\"motors-drives\">电机</a>、液压、气动间定位；流体动力在力密度上仍不可替代，正接入<a href=\"../systems/iot-smart-sensing\">智能控制</a>走向数字化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"液压与气动","id":"液压与气动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"帕斯卡原理：流体如何放大力","id":"帕斯卡原理-流体如何放大力"},{"level":2,"text":"元件构成：从泵阀到缸","id":"元件构成-从泵阀到缸"},{"level":2,"text":"电控融合：比例阀与电液伺服","id":"电控融合-比例阀与电液伺服"},{"level":2,"text":"选型与系统取舍","id":"选型与系统取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电磁与压电执行器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/electromagnetic-piezo"},"next":{"title":"传感器融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems/sensor-fusion"}}